    <div class=" sect-head ">
      <div class=" eyebrow on-navy ">The 7-Point Smile Design Protocol</div>
      <h2 class=" display " style=" margin-top:14px ">Seven design decisions on every case.</h2>
      <p class=" sub ">
        Most snap-on veneer companies ship whatever comes off the line. Revive Veneers is designed against a seven-point
        protocol Dr. Turley developed in his cosmetic dental practice. Every case. If it doesn't pass, it doesn't ship.
      </p>
    </div>
