            >01
          </span>
          <h3>Smile Architecture</h3>
          <p
            class=" pdesc "
          >
            How the smile sits on your face. Proportion, symmetry, presence. Dr. Turley evaluates how the veneers will
            frame your specific facial structure, not against a generic template.
          </p>
          <p
            class=" pfail "
          >
            <strong>Common failure in cheap snap-ons </strong>
            Cheap snap-ons use one universal shape regardless of face shape, making them look obviously fake on anyone
            whose face proportions don't match the mold.
          </p>
          <p
            class=" pmeans "
          >
            <strong>What this means for you </strong>
            Your veneers will look proportional to your face, not like you're wearing someone else's smile.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
