          </span>
          <h3>Gumline Design</h3>
          <p
            class=" pdesc "
          >
            How the veneers meet your gums. The protocol designs the gumline contour to follow your natural gum
            architecture, with appropriate thickness reduction at the margin.
          </p>
          <p
            class=" pfail "
          >
            <strong>The most visible flaw in cheap snap-ons </strong>
            The #1 visual giveaway of cheap snap-ons is the visible plastic gap between the veneer edge and the gum. It
            looks fake from across a room.
          </p>
          <p
            class=" pmeans "
          >
            <strong>What this means for you </strong>
            When you smile, no one sees a plastic line between your teeth and your gums.
          </p>
        </div>
      </article>
